        "\n",
        "I have written about differential form before ([What are „differential\n",
        "forms](../differential_forms/)), but there I have never adressed the elephant in\n",
        "the room, of *why*, we should consider $df$ as a covector field. Neither have I\n",
        "given any explanation about *what* $dx$ could mean. Even less so, what\n",
        "$\\frac{df}{dx}$ could be."
